</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:12px 28px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:bold;color:#101828;">Automate GitHub PR reviews, fixes, and approvals with Claude Ship</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 28px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#27324A;">Anthropic launched Claude Ship in beta for GitHub repositories on Team and Enterprise plans. It pairs the existing Code Review feature with two new beta agents, PR Steward and Claude Approvals, to fix failing CI checks, resolve merge conflicts, and approve routine code changes.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:12px 28px 0;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top" style="padding:0 8px 8px 0;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#F3F5F9" style="padding:6px 10px;background:#F3F5F9;"><div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:#101828;line-height:1.2;white-space:nowrap;">Team &amp; Enterprise</div><div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#5B6578;line-height:1.3;white-space:nowrap;">eligible plan tiers</div></td></tr></table></td><td valign="top" style="padding:0 8px 8px 0;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#F3F5F9" style="padding:6px 10px;background:#F3F5F9;"><div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:#101828;line-height:1.2;white-space:nowrap;">Quick, Standard, Deep</div><div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#5B6578;line-height:1.3;white-space:nowrap;">available review settings</div></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:12px 28px 0;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
<td style="border-left:3px solid #2E4BE0;padding:2px 0 2px 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#27324A;">
<div style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:bold;color:#2E4BE0;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;">WHY IT MATTERS TO YOU</div>AI coding agents generate substantial code, creating bottlenecks during review. Automating routine fixes and policy checks keeps pull requests moving fast.</td>
</tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:10px 28px 0;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
<td bgcolor="#F0F4FF" style="background:#F0F4FF;padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#27324A;">
<div style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:bold;color:#2E4BE0;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;">TRY IT IN 5 MINUTES</div>Enable <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">Claude Ship</code> on one GitHub repository. Add a natural language policy file to your project directory, run <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">Claude Approvals</code> in observe-only mode first, and set a monthly spending limit to manage <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">PR Steward</code> token usage.</td>
</tr></table></td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:10px 28px 0;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#27324A;"><div style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:bold;color:#8A5F00;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;">WATCH OUT</div><div style="padding-top:3px;">- <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">PR Steward</code> has no spending cap by default, so set a custom monthly budget to keep usage costs in check.</div><div style="padding-top:3px;">- Organizations with specific data privacy requirements cannot use the <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">Claude Ship</code> feature.</div></td></tr>

